Add the following testing categories:

### Authorization matrix testing

Test roles, audiences, relationships, resource states, and actions.

Include both permitted and forbidden access.

### Concurrency testing

Test simultaneous friend requests, reactions, message submissions, group membership changes, and repeated requests.

### Resilience testing

Test Redis outages, queue failures, storage timeouts, interrupted uploads, database connectivity issues, and failed external providers.

### Performance testing

Test feed pagination, search, messaging, media upload, and WebSocket load using realistic workloads.

### Accessibility testing

Run automated checks and perform manual keyboard and screen-reader reviews.

### Calling tests

Test signaling, permissions, TURN connectivity, connection failure, reconnection, and real multi-device media connectivity.

### Release gates

Critical security and authorization tests must pass before release.

Report the actual tests executed, their results, skipped tests, and known limitations.

Never claim an unexecuted test passed.

